{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Spellcasting Ability Score 15 or higher, proficiency in Arcana, the ability to cast at least one spell\n\nYou are a true master of the school of magic you have chosen to specialize in. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- When you gain this feat, choose one school of magic. You gain a +1 bonus to spell attacks and to your spell save DC with spells from the chosen school.\n\n- Whenever you are attacked or makes a save against a spell from the chosen school, you gain +1 to your AC or to your saving throw against that spell.\n\n- You have advantage on saving throws against spells from the chosen school.","level":1}],"id":"Customac290ea4-7006-47ab-be89-da006816d57d","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Arcane Mastery [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}